most up-to-date framework for creating

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:26.549
windows, and it's going to look the best
on a lot of systems, so this is going to

00:01:26.549 --> 00:01:33.240
be the most cross platform compatible
GUI that you're going to find pretty much.

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:38.040
And you can you can easily change
the style so like with Tkinter, you can

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:43.740
