lot of code.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:50.840
So with Qt, it comes with a bunch of
styles, but also comes with a lot of

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:57.160
really intuitive widgets that just make
sense to have pre-built in.

00:01:57.160 --> 00:02:02.219
